                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "三、说明"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                127,
                476,
                230,
                498
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1. 装置测量与分析的信号 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "u _ { \\mathrm { a } }"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "或 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "u _ { \\mathrm { b } }"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "是由基波分量与1个或者2个谐波分量组合而成的周期信号。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                127,
                512,
                868,
                554
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2. 装置在时域测量分析状态下，测量显示的电压有效值应为“真有效值”。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                166,
                560,
                835,
                577
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "3．装置在频域测量分析状态下，显示的 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "u _ { \\mathrm { a } }"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "或 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "u _ { \\mathrm { b } }"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "电压频谱应为在正频率轴上分布的频率分量。如信号源输出的由基波与其三次、四次谐波组合而成的周期信号表达式为 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "u = U _ { \\mathrm { 1 } } \\sin \\left( 2 \\pi \\times 1 0 . 5 \\times 1 0 ^ { 3 } t \\right) + U _ { \\mathrm { 3 } } \\sin \\left( 2 \\pi \\times 3 1 . 5 \\times 1 0 ^ { 3 } t \\right) + U _ { \\mathrm { 4 } } \\sin \\left( 2 \\pi \\times 4 2 . 0 \\times 1 0 ^ { 3 } t \\right) \\left( \\mathrm { m V } \\times \\mathrm { , } \\mathrm { ~ m } \\right)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "）时，装置显示的电压频谱各分量的频率和幅值应为："
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                127,
                586,
                868,
                678
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "10.5 kHz，U mV 31.5 kHz，U<sub>3</sub> mV 42.0kHz， "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "U _ { 4 }"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "mV"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                163,
                686,
                329,
                753
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
